{
  "title": "CloudFormation · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "AWS 인프라 구성을 템플릿으로 정의하고 반복 배포합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudFormation</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#guide-1\">템플릿에서 리소스 배포까지</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#guide-2\">변경과 데이터 보존 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>08 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudFormation</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>CloudFormation은 <strong>AWS 리소스를 코드로 정의하고 생성·변경·삭제하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 네트워크, 서버, 데이터베이스 등의 설정을 템플릿에 기록해 같은 구성을 반복해서 배포할 수 있습니다.</p><p>템플릿으로 함께 관리하는 리소스 묶음을 스택<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>이라고 합니다. 환경별 설정을 입력값으로 나누면 개발·검증·운영 환경에도 같은 구조를 적용하기 쉽습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"templates-and-resources\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"intrinsic-functions-and-dependencies\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"stacks-and-change-sets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"updates-replacement-and-rollback\"></span><h2>템플릿에서 리소스 배포까지</h2><p>YAML 또는 JSON 템플릿에 리소스와 속성을 정의합니다. 리소스 간 참조를 사용하면 필요한 연결 값과 생성 의존 관계를 표현할 수 있습니다.</p><p>변경 세트로 적용할 변경을 미리 확인하고 업데이트합니다. 일부 속성 변경은 기존 리소스를 수정하는 대신 새 리소스로 교체할 수 있으므로 데이터를 보존할 방법을 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"deletionpolicy-and-updatereplacepolicy\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"drift-detection\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"nested-stacks-and-stacksets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"custom-resources-hooks-and-iam\"></span><h2>변경과 데이터 보존 관리</h2><p>DeletionPolicy와 UpdateReplacePolicy 등으로 삭제·교체 때 리소스를 보존하거나 스냅샷을 만들도록 설정할 수 있습니다. 실패 시 롤백 동작도 업무 영향과 함께 검토합니다.</p><p>템플릿 밖에서 직접 바꾼 설정은 드리프트 탐지로 확인합니다. 여러 계정이나 리전에 같은 구성을 배포할 때는 StackSets 등의 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>코드로 인프라 변경</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>템플릿 작성</strong><span>필요한 리소스 정의</span></li><li><strong>변경 확인</strong><span>생성·수정·교체 검토</span></li><li><strong>스택 배포</strong><span>리소스를 함께 관리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">템플릿 변경을 검토 가능한 인프라 변경으로 연결합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>개발 환경에서 검증한 VPC와 서버 구성을 같은 템플릿으로 운영에 배포합니다. 데이터베이스 교체가 포함되면 변경 세트에서 확인하고 보존 정책을 적용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>스택</strong> — 하나의 CloudFormation 템플릿으로 생성하고 함께 관리하는 리소스 집합입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSCloudFormation/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is CloudFormation? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q079/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q079\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q079\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q079</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q079/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to deploy a large application into multiple accounts from repeatable infrastructure templates. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q079\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q079\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q079\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q079\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">CloudFormation</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 인프라를 선언적 템플릿·스택으로 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">CloudFormation</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q078\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,2\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q093\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q005\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q022\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">이전 용어 <b>Budgets / Cost Explorer</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudFront</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
